{"type":"text","timestamp":1794540183784,"sessionID":"ses_e2d1486c8ffeG6hsQuEtK6ngKc","part":{"id":"prt_1d2ee15cc002e4QLDtfjmwMhkP","sessionID":"ses_e2d1486c8ffeG6hsQuEtK6ngKc","messageID":"msg_1d2edfe58001FGtEEdOabWQLAR","type":"text","text":"T008 complete.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` — added `typedCommandIn(prompt)` (lowercase match of the longest `TRACKED_COMMANDS` key on a start boundary and a non-word/colon/hyphen end boundary) and `typedCommandForTop(topSkillId, prompt)` (returns `{ command, policy, ownerSkillId }` when the top skill owns the command or its command row carries the same command). Also exported the `TypedCommand` return shape.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach.vitest.ts` — added the six named cases in a `typed command on the leading recommendation` describe block.\n\nThe pre-existing uncommitted T003 work in `command-attach.ts` (`TrackedCommand`, `TRACKED_COMMANDS`) was read and left untouched.\n\n**Verify output**\n\n`VCA` — `npx vitest run tests/command-attach.vitest.ts` in `ADV`:\n```\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  8 passed (8)\n```\n\n`TC` — `npm run typecheck` in `ADV`:\n```\n> typecheck\n> ../../system-spec-kit/node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit --composite false -p tsconfig.build.json\nexit=0\n```\n\n0 failed, typecheck exit 0. Checkbox in `tasks.md` left unticked as instructed. Nothing was blocked.","time":{"start":1794540180940,"end":1794540183784}}}
